# Instagram AI Manager — Agent Rules

Har doim `PROJECT_CONTEXT.md` ni o‘qi.
Kundalik o‘zgarishlar: `.cursor/md/YYYY-MM-DD.md` (oxirgi sanani o‘qi).

## Mahsulot

Multi-Tenant SaaS. `tenant_id` server membership / JWT claim’dan; client header’iga ishonilmaydi.

## Joriy holat

**Auth Phase-1 + H2 + H1 DONE.**
**M0/M1 Instagram Connect & Media Sync (BE+UI) DONE** — default `INSTAGRAM_ENABLED=false`.
**Post filter/video + metrics/comments sync DONE** (metrics `004` CREATE; comments `005`).
**Content Publishing DONE** (Liquibase 006; IMAGE/REELS/STORIES/CAROUSEL; public HTTPS staging).
**Content AI analysis Phase-1 DONE** (Liquibase 007 CREATE; manual UI select).
**Hali ochiq (ruxsat bilan):** Meta live OAuth (third-party portfolio); Platform Admin UI; analysis UI polish; async publish queue.

## Taqiqlangan (ruxsatsiz)

- Media Management CRUD (library edit/delete)
- AI Agent / Video Factory
- Redis/Ollama o‘zgartirish
- Boot/Angular downgrade
- `spring.liquibase.drop-first=true` asosiy/prod konfiguratsiyada
- Production bootstrap admin / sync-password
- Platform tenant block/delete/subscription mutatsiyalari (H1 faqat read-only)
- Liquibase rename: `logicalFilePath` / checksum buzish
- **Test bosqich:** schema o‘zgarishi → **CREATE** (yangi jadval / asosiy CREATE faylga qo‘shish). **`ALTER` yozilmasin** — lokal DB o‘chirib qayta yaratiladi (`LIQUIBASE_DROP_FIRST` yoki drop database)

## Stack

- `BE/`: Java 21, Spring Boot 4.1.2, `uzeduai.be` (Jackson 3: `tools.jackson.*`)
- Profiles: `dev` (default), `prod`, `test`
- Liquibase: **SQL** `001`…`007`; yangi ustunlar test’da CREATE ichida; `logicalFilePath` eski id
- `UI/`: Angular 22 + Tailwind 4, auth memory token, HttpOnly refresh, XSRF
- Routes: `/auth/*`, `/app/{dashboard,tenants,workspaces,instagram,access}`
- Page access: admin `/app/access`; PLATFORM_ADMIN hammasi ochiq
- API envelope: `{ success, data, messageKey, messageArgs, timestamp }`
- i18n: uz (lotin) / ru / en — BE key, UI tarjima

## Auth / Tenant / Platform / Instagram

- Access: memory; Refresh: `iam_refresh` HttpOnly + SHA-256 + rotation
- Reuse → family revoke (`RefreshTokenRevocationService` REQUIRES_NEW)
- Parallel refresh: atomic `markRevokedIfActive` (fork yo‘q)
- Logout: refresh cookie + CSRF; access token shart emas
- Prod: `JWT_SECRET`, `IG_TOKEN_ENCRYPTION_KEY`, `DB_*`, Secure cookie
- Roles: platform `PLATFORM_ADMIN`; tenant `OWNER|ADMIN|MEMBER`
- Bootstrap: faqat local/dev/test — `admin@local.dev` / `0110`
- JWT tenant/workspace claim’lar har requestda `TenantMembershipService` bilan DB’da qayta tekshiriladi
- `TenantContextHolder` request `finally` da tozalanadi
- `/api/v1/tenants` = membership; `/api/v1/platform/**` = PLATFORM_ADMIN inventory
- Instagram: `/api/v1/instagram/**` + oauth callback permitAll; page `INSTAGRAM`

